<title>UK: Euroclear launches website.</title>
<headline>Euroclear launches website.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euroclear has launched its own website, the clearing and settlement system for international securities said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The address is http://www.euroclear.com.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
